#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Companies on a map"
msgstr "Cuideachtaí ar léarscáil"

#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Show where the companies are on a map, and place a company from the town typed in its location, using a table of cities kept on this server. Switched off, there is no map page and no location is placed; the coordinates already stored stay recorded and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Taispeáin áit a bhfuil na cuideachtaí ar léarscáil, agus cuir cuideachta ón mbaile clóscríofa ina suíomh, ag baint úsáide as tábla cathracha a choimeádtar ar an bhfreastalaí. Athraigh amach, níl aon leathanach léarscáil agus níl aon suíomh a chur; na comhordanáidí atá stóráilte cheana féin fanacht a thaifeadadh agus teacht ar ais untouched nuair a bhíonn sé aistrigh arís."
